{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22385","headline":"念金銮子二首 一 · 白居易","name":"念金銮子二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衰病四十身，娇痴三岁女。\n非男犹胜无，慰情时一抚。\n一朝舍我去，魂影无处所。\n况念夭札时，呕哑初学语。\n始知骨肉爱，乃是忧悲聚。\n唯思未有前，以理遣伤苦。\n忘怀日已久，三度移寒暑。\n今日一伤心，因逢旧乳母。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}